WEBVTT

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:04.120
You're your own person

00:02:05.010 --> 00:02:07.290
Sharla! Howard!

00:02:10.410 --> 00:02:11.490
What's going on?

00:02:11.570 --> 00:02:12.390
What happened?

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:15.790
Sharla and Howard were Survive's spies!

00:02:18.390 --> 00:02:22.030
We were lyin' when we said there was an unused program unit.

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:24.510
It was to test Howard 'n Sharla.

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:25.760
Test?

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:31.480
They probably had nanomachines put in their bodies, and are being manipulated by Survive.

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:35.520
Being manipulated?

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:39.960
Then they can't return to their former selves?

00:02:41.230 --> 00:02:41.870
That can't...

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:44.760
Luna!

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:02.590
Bad news! Survive's prob'ly figured out the location o' this hidden area!

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:07.780
That's right! It will only be a matter of time before the drones make it here!

00:03:07.780 --> 00:03:09.600
Oh no! Oh no!

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:17.610
Howard! Sharla!

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:18.360
Wait, Luna!

00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:29.760
Luna, it's impossible right now. Let's go back for the time being.

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:39.460
Oh no! Oh no! The drones are coming!

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:40.670
What do we do?

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:42.170
We have no choice but to abandon this place.

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:45.320
Tako, are there any other safe places?

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:46.470
There aren't!

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:51.390
Then we should head for the main room, where Survive itself is located.

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:53.040
What kind of reckless...

00:03:53.490 --> 00:03:54.020
No...

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:56.870
...there's a limit to the number of places we can hide.

00:03:57.090 --> 00:04:01.780
And also, and also, if we don't hurry, Sharla and Howard...

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:05.640
But what about the drones?

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:06.610
Hey, hey!

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:09.060
I found this thing.

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:14.580
That's an infrared ray inhibitor particle nebulizer, used for terraforming.

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:19.030
The mirror confused the drone before.

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:20.840
Maybe this will work.

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:24.810
No, that's quite impossible.

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:38.460
It's certainly an effective substance, but my sensors will not fall victim to such a thing...

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:40.710
Looks like it's workin' just fine.

00:04:45.960 --> 00:04:47.830
Looks like we've no choice but to take a chance on it.

00:05:00.510 --> 00:05:03.390
But I have just one question.

00:05:04.140 --> 00:05:07.010
Why didn't Howard and Sharla kill us right away?

00:05:07.670 --> 00:05:10.510
They certainly had every chance to.

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:13.220
It's bothered me all along.

00:05:13.820 --> 00:05:17.020
Ever since they got back, they've just been looking at Luna.

00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:18.960
I felt so too.

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:23.870
Maybe they were investigating Luna's mysterious power.

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:26.530
My power?

00:05:27.020 --> 00:05:29.030
When I saved Adam in the lake...

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:32.310
...it seemed for a moment like Adam was floating.

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:36.020
Perhaps that was an effect of Luna's psychic powers.

00:05:36.510 --> 00:05:37.670
Psychic powers?

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:39.170
Mine?

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:40.180
Maybe...

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:43.180
...it's because of the nanomachines.

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:44.640
But...

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:48.020
They're here!

00:05:59.570 --> 00:06:00.960
--We did it!
--It's workin'!

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:01.710
Let's go!

00:06:01.780 --> 00:06:02.910
Good idea!

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:04.780
--Let's hurry!
--This way!

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:15.880
That mysterious power of Luna's...

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:20.570
I need that power that Luna has.

00:06:21.320 --> 00:06:25.970
I must analyze this unknown power and take it into myself.

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:28.480
It must be done as quickly as possible.

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:32.340
If I cannot obtain that power...

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:35.530
...it will be impossible to save this planet.

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:41.790
Alright, now!

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:45.170
Lookin' good! We'll make it at this rate!

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:54.920
Take cover!

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:00.960
Kaoru...

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:03.660
This is an elevator.

00:07:04.140 --> 00:07:04.860
Over here too!

00:07:05.310 --> 00:07:07.520
Luna, let's split into two groups.

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:10.380
Got it! We'll meet up in the main room.

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:13.820
Look out, Bell!

00:07:21.660 --> 00:07:22.630
Luna, get in!

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:32.910
The area 'round the main room should have only a few drones.

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:34.780
We just hafta evade 'em 'n we're there!

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:45.660
Alright, now!

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:47.160
This way.

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:49.520
The main room's up here.

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:53.120
This way.

00:07:53.830 --> 00:07:57.170
There will be few drones along this route.

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:10.110
Sharla!

00:08:14.570 --> 00:08:15.320
Look out!

00:08:19.070 --> 00:08:21.020
Sharla! Stop it!

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:25.590
As expected, Sharla's completely subjugated.

00:08:25.930 --> 00:08:26.570
What do we do?

00:08:26.570 --> 00:08:27.660
Damn it...

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:35.640
You okay?

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:39.760
I've recovered. You?

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:43.030
I'm fine. I can run.

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:46.690
Yeah, that's the spirit!

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:48.320
Alright. Let's go.

00:08:57.540 --> 00:08:59.680
She's getting closer and closer.

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:02.790
What do we do? This won't work on Sharla.

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:03.880
I'll go.

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:07.820
Sharla!

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:19.820
Sorry, Sharla...

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:23.390
Bell, how's Sharla?

00:09:24.990 --> 00:09:27.390
She's fine. She's just unconscious.

00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:29.040
Now, let's hurry.

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:38.340
That's it. That's the main room.

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:42.840
Survive itself is in there, right?

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:43.520
Yep.

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:46.750
They're back!

00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:49.740
Damn it! Hide!

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:53.640
Damn it!

00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:05.340
Luna!

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:07.560
Crap! We stirred the hive!

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:08.310
Damn it...

00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:39.770
Luna...

00:10:43.480 --> 00:10:44.460
I...

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:10.370
Luna...

00:11:10.860 --> 00:11:11.940
Let's go.

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:29.750
Howard!

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:30.540
Wait!

00:11:31.260 --> 00:11:31.890
Luna!

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:33.880
Howard?

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:37.820
Howard!

00:11:41.570 --> 00:11:42.660
Don't move.

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:44.740
You either, Kaoru.

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:47.340
If you move, I'll shoot Adam.

00:11:47.870 --> 00:11:49.480
Chako and Kaoru, step back.

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:55.220
That's fine.

00:12:03.090 --> 00:12:04.260
You're Survive?

00:12:05.010 --> 00:12:06.390
Why are you doing this?

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:09.260
I want your power.

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:11.530
My... power?

00:12:12.430 --> 00:12:18.020
Yes. You have a mysterious power which nanomachines cannot explain.

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:23.570
I want to analyze this unseen power to determine its source.

00:12:23.980 --> 00:12:26.570
And I want to obtain this power.

00:12:27.020 --> 00:12:29.990
Why? I thought people were unnecessary!

00:12:30.690 --> 00:12:35.000
Yes. But you have used a power not in my data.

00:12:35.490 --> 00:12:40.110
If I can obtain that power, I will be able to achieve further progress.

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:41.920
Don't be so selfish!

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:43.920
I shall have you let me investigate.

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:48.060
Luna!

00:12:49.820 --> 00:12:51.880
I'm... fine...

00:12:56.190 --> 00:12:59.790
I...'m... fine...

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:03.840
There certainly are nanomachines in your body.

00:13:04.140 --> 00:13:08.780
But apart from that, there is no particular difference between you and your comrades.

00:13:09.390 --> 00:13:13.790
Why? Why do you alone have this special power?

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:15.280
How should I know?

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:21.790
Luna!

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:23.170
Don't move.

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:29.160
I told you not to move.

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:34.260
Put down Sharla and go over by Kaoru.

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:39.170
Sharla, come this way.

00:13:41.270 --> 00:13:43.890
Oh, and leave the weapons there.

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:47.490
That's fine.

00:13:47.940 --> 00:13:51.770
Survive! If you want to investigate me, do as you like!

00:13:52.070 --> 00:13:55.930
But in return, turn Howard and Sharla back to normal!

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:58.910
They're our precious friends!

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:00.660
Friends?

00:14:01.260 --> 00:14:04.080
According to my experiments,

00:14:04.090 --> 00:14:06.920
your mysterious power emerges when you are trying to help your friends.

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:08.940
Experiments?

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:12.660
You seem not to have realized it yet.

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:16.440
I took those two so I could investigate you.

00:14:16.860 --> 00:14:19.860
And I put nanomachines in them as well.

00:14:20.640 --> 00:14:25.740
But no significant difference appeared between these two and the people of this world.

00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:29.700
For the sake of an experiment, you did that to them?

00:14:30.770 --> 00:14:35.230
Therefore, I required further experiments.

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:43.560
At that time, your proficiency with your mysterious power increased.

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:52.630
For that... You risked someone's life for that?

00:14:57.770 --> 00:15:00.320
Just now, I sensed your power.

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:02.460
Inexcusable.

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:07.730
Is this the source of your power?

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:12.880
I know this.

00:15:14.190 --> 00:15:20.790
This feeling of "fury" which appears when you foolish people lose control of your emotions.

00:15:21.020 --> 00:15:21.660
Luna...

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:24.470
Yes, fury and hatred.

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:30.020
If I can absorb these emotions, will I be able to obtain this new power?

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:32.460
Luna! Stop, Luna!

00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:39.640
I...

00:15:40.220 --> 00:15:43.070
What's wrong? Your power faded.

00:15:43.560 --> 00:15:46.260
Please, stop doing these ridiculous things!

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:49.270
I just want to talk with you!

00:15:49.930 --> 00:15:51.920
Such a talk would be meaningless.

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:55.490
All that interests me is that power of yours.

00:15:55.820 --> 00:16:01.750
This unthinkable power that you, a mere living creature, can generate. That is all.

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:04.250
Howard! Shoot Adam!

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:21.990
Lu... Luna...

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:27.980
Now, show me your power. Your friend is in danger!

00:16:28.110 --> 00:16:29.460
Hate! Despise!

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:34.220
Yes! Another person driven by rage and hatred...

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:39.690
...repeats the same foolish actions, and has shown a power strong enough to destroy a planet!

00:16:43.820 --> 00:16:48.390
Changing planets other than Earth so that humans can live on them...

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:51.470
...if you thought that way of every planet in space...

00:16:51.620 --> 00:16:54.660
...seems like it might be arrogant.

00:16:57.060 --> 00:17:01.670
While we know that compared to the great work that is space...

00:17:01.670 --> 00:17:03.920
...it may be an incomparably small thing...

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:10.890
...but we struggle hard because little by little, we want to cultivate the tree of life on lifeless planets.

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:14.270
That's how I feel.

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:24.430
The tree of life...

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:27.810
Dad...

00:17:28.930 --> 00:17:31.930
Luna, I want you to cultivate it too.

00:17:32.420 --> 00:17:33.580
Dad...

00:17:35.160 --> 00:17:38.570
Howard and Sharla won't harm Adam.

00:17:38.940 --> 00:17:41.340
Because we're friends!

00:17:41.610 --> 00:17:42.430
Luna!

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:49.440
Because we are friends, and inheritors of the tree of life!

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:54.840
This is...

00:18:01.780 --> 00:18:04.440
Howard! Sharla!

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:06.020
Who's that?

00:18:06.320 --> 00:18:07.590
Who is it?

00:18:09.470 --> 00:18:10.290
It's me.

00:18:11.080 --> 00:18:11.720
It's Luna!

00:18:13.560 --> 00:18:15.660
I'm here too.

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:18.690
Howard! Sharla!

00:18:19.710 --> 00:18:21.580
It's me! Adam!

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:24.770
I'm here too!

00:18:27.090 --> 00:18:29.420
Have you forgotten about all of us?

00:18:29.640 --> 00:18:30.510
No.

00:18:30.810 --> 00:18:32.510
We haven't forgotten.

00:18:32.980 --> 00:18:37.220
We may have fought all the time, but it was fun!

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:38.570
Don't you remember?

00:18:39.210 --> 00:18:40.410
I remember.

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:43.480
But now we're with Survive.

00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:47.980
That's right. We're with Survive.

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:49.290
That's not true!

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:52.740
You are your own people.

00:19:01.110 --> 00:19:03.430
You're your own person!

00:19:13.560 --> 00:19:15.920
I am...

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:20.680
I'm my own person?

00:19:21.240 --> 00:19:24.170
Yes. You do not belong to anyone else.

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:26.830
Your heart ought to be free.

00:19:28.260 --> 00:19:29.720
Not ruled by anyone else.

00:19:30.090 --> 00:19:31.370
Not ruling anyone else.

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:34.590
We are ourselves.

00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:36.020
And friends.

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:38.310
Friends?

00:19:38.460 --> 00:19:39.280
That's right!

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:40.520
You oughtta know.

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:43.180
We're friends!

00:19:44.270 --> 00:19:45.510
Friends...

00:19:51.130 --> 00:19:52.860
Everyone was always there.

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:55.670
Friends were always there.

00:19:55.890 --> 00:19:57.170
Cheers!

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:58.410
In fun times...

00:19:58.930 --> 00:19:59.940
...happy times...

00:20:01.860 --> 00:20:02.680
Sharla!

00:20:05.570 --> 00:20:06.360
Luna!

00:20:06.540 --> 00:20:07.930
...sad times...

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:09.730
...and lonely times...

00:20:12.990 --> 00:20:16.630
...everyone laughed and cried together

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:23.870
And with hope in our hearts...

00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:26.830
...through whatever hardships...

00:20:27.470 --> 00:20:30.060
...we cheerfully overcame them together.

00:20:30.360 --> 00:20:32.870
Everyone, take a good look!

00:20:44.420 --> 00:20:46.260
And together...

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:47.760
...we lived.

00:20:48.360 --> 00:20:49.890
Howard! Sharla!

00:20:50.010 --> 00:20:50.720
Howard!

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:51.390
Sharla!

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:52.030
Howard!

00:20:52.030 --> 00:20:53.230
Sharla!

00:21:00.960 --> 00:21:02.310
That is...

00:21:26.830 --> 00:21:28.780
Howard... Sharla...

00:21:42.020 --> 00:21:43.290
Come back to us.

00:22:01.410 --> 00:22:05.160
That's it! That's the power!

00:22:06.430 --> 00:22:09.130
Why am I in a place like this?

00:22:11.190 --> 00:22:12.430
What's this?

00:22:12.990 --> 00:22:14.010
You've come to!

00:22:14.790 --> 00:22:15.770
Luna?

00:22:18.280 --> 00:22:19.520
What is it, Luna?

00:22:32.460 --> 00:22:34.930
What is this power?

00:22:35.980 --> 00:22:41.270
It does not conform to any mental state in the people I knew.

00:22:41.490 --> 00:22:47.120
And though peaceful, it was strong enough to break free.

00:23:02.570 --> 00:23:05.340
What's going on on this planet?

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:13.220
I do not know. But to protect this planet, I will need all of your power.

00:23:13.440 --> 00:23:17.340
Don't be so selfish! Relying on people after all that...

00:23:17.340 --> 00:23:22.410
Wait! Just as Survive says, there may be something we can do.

00:23:22.630 --> 00:23:24.060
We, as people...

00:23:25.480 --> 00:23:28.480
Next time: At this rate, this planet...
